          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The notion of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            can be formulated
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internalization"} internal
            to any other category with enough
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullbacks
          %p
            By regarding
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group"} groups
            as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pointed+object"} pointed
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-connected+object+of+an+%28infinity%2C1%29-topos"} connected
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping"}> delooping
            )
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoid"} groupoids
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+groups"} internal groups
          %p
            An ordinary
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/small+category"} small category
            is a category internal to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Set"} Set
          %p
            There is a more general notion of an
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+category+in+a+monoidal+category"} internal category in a monoidal category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullbacks"} pullbacks
            are replaced by cotensor products.
          %h2#definition Definition
          %h3#internal_category Internal category
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
            be a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            with
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullbacks"} pullbacks
            %strong
              category internal to
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
            consists of
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                an
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/object"} object
                %em of objects
                = succeed ";" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi C
                          %mn 0
                        %mo ∈
                        %mi A
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C_0 \in A
            %li
              %p
                an
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/object"} object
                %em of morphisms
                = succeed ";" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi C
                          %mn 1
                        %mo ∈
                        %mi A
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C_1 \in A
          %p together with
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/source"} source
                and
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/target"} target
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/morphisms"} morphisms
                = succeed ";" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi s
                        %mo ,
                        %mi t
                        %mo :
                        %msub
                          %mi C
                          %mn 1
                        %mo →
                        %msub
                          %mi C
                          %mn 0
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} s,t: C_1 \to C_0
            %li
              %p
                an
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity-assigning+morphism"} identity-assigning morphism
                = succeed ";" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi e
                        %mo :
                        %msub
                          %mi C
                          %mn 0
                        %mo →
                        %msub
                          %mi C
                          %mn 1
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} e: C_0 \to C_1
            %li
              %p
                a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/composition"} composition
                morphism
                = succeed ";" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi c
                        %mo :
