          %p
            Notice that inherent to this definition is the assumption that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullbacks"} pullbacks
            involved actually exist. This holds automatically when the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ambient+category"} ambient category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
            has finite
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limit"} limits
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                  %mo =
                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A =\,
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Diff"} Diff
            where this is not the case. Here it is helpful to assume simply that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi s
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} s
            and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi t
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} t
            have all
            = succeed ";" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullbacks"} pullbacks
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Diff
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Diff
            this occurs if they are submersions.
          %h3#internal_groupoid Internal groupoid
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoid"} groupoid
            internal to
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
            is all of the above
